---
title: "Annotation Workflow"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  s0: Awaiting session start
  s1: Load first-step document
  s2: Step 1: Read and annotate document
  s3: Document or access error
  s4: Confirm finish
  s5: Submitting session
  s6: Session finished
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: Start [admitted writable session]
  s1 --> s2: Document loaded
  s1 --> s3: Document load fails
  s2 --> s4: Finish
  s3 --> s1: Reload after resolving problem
  s4 --> s5: Confirm finish [study not closed]
  s5 --> s6: Server accepts finish#59; end timestamp set
  s5 --> s2: Server rejects finish#59; show error
